 *   tree (trees/draw.ts); every instance carries `treeFade` = (fade 0..1, role, casts shadow, debug code). Role 0 =
 *   solid, 1 = outgoing (keeps the pixels whose fixed screen dither value is >= fade), 2 = incoming (keeps < fade),
 *   3 = shadow caster only. Both levels of a fading tree use the same mask and value, so each pixel is covered once.
 *   Shadow casters are never dithered. Instances with nothing to draw collapse in the vertex shader.
 * - **Wind** (trees/Foliage.md#wind): the trunk bends with height^2, each limb sways about the trunk with its own
 *   phase and an amplitude growing with branch order and distance along the limb (`treeWind`), leaves flutter. The
 *   impostor applies the trunk term only.
 * - **Colour** (trees/Foliage.md#shading): per-instance hue / value (`treeInst`), baked ambient occlusion, leaf
